  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2wMZKZ7B6E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/735938861636780042?style=flat-square&logo=discord&label=Discord&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcozary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-Ko--fi-F16061?style=flat-square&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> • <a href=\"https://github.com/Cozary/Colored-Water/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Cozary/Colored-Water?style=flat-square&logo=github&logoColor=white&color=364763\" alt=\"Issues\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fcolored-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/colored-water/localized.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hEzgIwf.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>關於</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">正在尋找一個簡單的裝飾模組嗎？本模組加入了彩色水，你可以用它們來隨意裝飾你的世界。模組還添加了濃縮彩色水，以及這兩者的發光變體！還有注水盆！！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>與 Optifine 不相容，但與 Rubidium 兼容！（坦白說，目前我還不太確定，在某些版本中可以運行，而在其他版本中似乎無法運行。）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6IzYmBQ.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mrVcZRn.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>現在你可以將彩色水倒入注水盆中！</em></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3PAo8LX.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>合成：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">合成方式直觀且簡單。你只需要收集一桶水和一種染料。濃縮水需要額外添加染料，而發光版本則使用螢石粉！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K6HY17M.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
